  "limitations": [
    "Native SQLite durability applies to the installed Reylumi native app; Safari Home Screen uses browser storage.",
    "Offline private authorization remains at most 24 hours. Saved drafts/queues survive lease expiry and need fresh authorized re-entry.",
    "Offline business commands require existing KINGPOS_PORTABLE_DRAFT_OUTBOX=1 and a matching signed localCommands grant.",
    "Legacy current-draft migration uses only the known recovery slot; it retains original browser data and never guesses other POS/tab ownership.",
